            <p><strong>Part 4: Conclusion.</strong></p>
            <p>The equation will look like this, where y represents the number of magic points left and the x represents the number of boss fights.</p>
            $$ y = \textcolor{#DA8359}{\left[ \text{slope} \right]}x + \textcolor{#729170}{\left[ y\text{-intercept} \right]} $$
